For each minimal largest-flank cover: does SOME OTHER flank have an uncovered residue class?
(that is the eighth-family mechanism: a free flank the sixth difference can be cleared on)

=== d_max = c = 8: 1 minimal cover(s) ===
  fixed differences [1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8]  <- eighth pattern
     flank   4: 1 uncovered residue(s) mod 4, e.g. k = [2]
     flank   5: 1 uncovered residue(s) mod 5, e.g. k = [4]
     flank   7: 2 uncovered residue(s) mod 7, e.g. k = [1, 3]

